                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-slate-100 pt-4">
                <div>
                  <span class="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase">Precio desde</span>
                  <span class="text-brand-navy text-2xl font-black">4.800 UF</span>
                </div>
                <a
                  href="#contacto"
                  class="hover:bg-brand-navy text-brand-navy rounded-lg bg-slate-100 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold transition-colors hover:text-white"
